  "markdown": "The Wallcovering Guide · Choose and source\n\n# Omexco\n\nOmexco designs and manufactures wall decorations in an atelier near Brussels. Its collections include printed, woven and natural surfaces. UK ordering goes through representatives; other territories use regional distributors. Website sample requests are for interior professionals.\n\n## Source evidence\n\nRead the maker’s information for the selected product and destination. A brand profile does not certify a seller or prove that an order will be accepted.\n\n- [Official source: omexco.com/belgian-savoir-faire](https://www.omexco.com/belgian-savoir-faire) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: omexco.com/wallcoverings/whisper](https://www.omexco.com/wallcoverings/whisper) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: omexco.com/contact](https://www.omexco.com/contact) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: omexco.com/faq](https://www.omexco.com/faq) — checked 17 October 2026\n\n[Visit maker website](https://www.omexco.com/)\n\n## Official sourcing routes\n\nCheck the route’s scope before ordering. Showrooms, samples and finder links do not establish a roll checkout or delivery promise.\n\n### Find a stockist or representative\n\nContact Omexco UK at uk@omexco.com; ask for the regional representative to place an order.\n\n**Region**\n: United Kingdom\n\n**UK access**\n: UK explicitly covered by maker’s direct/representative route.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nFAQ explicitly gives UK representative ordering. Consumer account eligibility and sample costs: not established; ask the maker.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Find a stockist or representative, United Kingdom](https://www.omexco.com/contact)\n\n### Find a stockist or representative\n\nFind the regional distributor in the maker’s directory; United States listing names Romo.\n\n**Region**\n: Outside UK, Ireland and France; United States example\n\n**UK access**\n: Overseas route is separate from the UK direct contact.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nFAQ directs overseas orders through regional distributors. Directory entries are listed by maker; no authorised label asserted.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Find a stockist or representative, Outside UK, Ireland and France; United States example](https://www.omexco.com/contact)\n\n### Samples\n\nSelect designs and use the website sample-request form as described in the FAQ.\n\n**Region**\n: Interior professionals; territory limits not stated\n\n**UK access**\n: UK sample delivery not explicitly verified.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: Not established; ask the maker about the selected destination.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nFor interior professionals; maximum five samples. Charges and UK sample delivery: not established; ask the maker.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Samples, Interior professionals; territory limits not stated](https://www.omexco.com/faq)\n\n[All makers](https://www.mrwallcover.com/makers/)\n\n## From sample to specification\n\nRecord the exact design and product code, check current instructions and establish the wall preparation before quantities and installation are agreed.\n\n[Discuss your wallcovering](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n",
